    "content": "<style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><div><style>\n  .email {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n</style><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin:0px auto 40px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"640\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly\" style=\"padding:36px 36px 0px 36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:640px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Dear {{ subscriber.first_name }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Thank you for joining our recent FP&amp;A Business Partnering webinar. We appreciate your active participation and insightful contributions, making the session a success and a lot of fun for Paul and I (despite Paul&#x27;s jokes).<br/>\u200b<br/> As a token of our appreciation, we are excited to offer you a free FP&amp;A resource guide that Paul has developed. Please also find a copy of the presentation attached and a link to the recording of the webinar. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;list-style-position:inside\"><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Access the guide here: <a href=\"https://community.plan-buddies.com/c/free-resources/ultimate-fp-a-resource-guide\" trigger-id=\"4245979\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Ultimate FP&amp;A Resource Guide | Plan Buddies (plan-buddies.com)</a>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Watch the recording: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/dZdkhjbk22M?si=zlSqf0Hg2bXdroCr\" trigger-id=\"4245978\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">https://youtu.be/dZdkhjbk22M?si=zlSqf0Hg2bXdroCr</a>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Learn more about the course here: <a href=\"https://www.thefpandaguy.com/fpa-course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Best Practice FP&amp;A Course \u2014 The FP&amp;A Guy (thefpandaguy.com)</a>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>\u200b<a href=\"https://download.filekitcdn.com/d/sQPykcbSSsHRVZVvj5Qcv9/a88Pfc5KFEMfb1t3y2aHeA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FP&amp;A Business Partnering and Influencing.pdf</a>\u200b<br/>\u200b</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Additionally, we understand the importance of continuous learning in FP&amp;A, and we&#x27;re delighted to extend a special offer to webinar attendees. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">For the next 48 hours, we want to offer you or a team member of yours a 10% discount on our comprehensive FP&amp;A course. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">If you&#x27;re interested, simply use the code<strong> FPandA10</strong> during checkout.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">The training is on :</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;list-style-position:inside\"><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Feb 12, 13, 20 &amp; 21 (2.5 hours a day) at 12.00 PM EST</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Buy the Course with this link. <a href=\"https://buy.stripe.com/5kA0423BGgoO30A3cn\" trigger-id=\"4245980\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Join the Course Today</a>\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<br/> Once again, thank you for your engagement in our webinar. We look forward to supporting your ongoing professional development in FP&amp;A.<br/>\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<br/> Warm regards,<br/>\u200b<br/> Paul Barnhurst<br/> The FP&amp;A Guy<br/>\u200b<br/> Ron Monteiro<br/> The Storytelling guy</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Sign up for our free newsletter: <a href=\"https://the-modern-finance-playbook.ck.page/profile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">The Modern Finance Playbook </a>\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Learn about our Corporate training: <a href=\"https://www.thefpandaguy.com/corporate-training\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Learn more</a>\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Contact us: <a href=\"mailto:ron.monteiro18@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">ron.monteiro18@gmail.com</a>, <a href=\"mailto:pbarnhurst@thefpandaguy.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">pbarnhurst@thefpandaguy.com</a>\u200b</p></div></div></td><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div><!--[if mso]><br /><br /><![endif]--></div></center></div><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin:0px auto 0px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly\" style=\"padding:18px 36px 18px 36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:520px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">{{ address }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-